			"Message": "refactor(Common): Remove aliased IPC event channels and consolidate naming\n\nRemove duplicate event channel definitions that were created by parallel emit sites:\n- StatusBarMessage (sky://status-bar/message) → merged into StatusBarSetMessage\n- TreeViewRegister (sky://treeView/register) → merged into TreeViewCreate\n- WebviewPostMessageCamelCase / WebviewSetHTMLCamelCase → removed, use kebab-form\n\nAdd clarifying comments documenting the canonical naming conventions for each\ndomain (kebab-case for tree-view/webview, no-hyphen for statusbar). Also add\na test that compares the Rust enum wire strings against the TypeScript mirror\nat Wind/Source/IPC/SkyEvent.ts to prevent future drift between the two.",
